  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{qV} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{A}}-\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{B}}=2 / 20=0.1 \\mathrm{~V}\n$$\nHere $W$ is the work done in moving charge $q$ from point $A$ to $B$",
